The '''Biox Detour''' was a [[hyperspace]] [[Hyperspace route|trade route]] that former [[pirate]] [[Queen]] [[Maz Kanata]] marked as one of the "real" trade routes for [[smuggler]]s to use, rather than official ones, in a map she included in the [[book]] that would become known as the ''[[Smuggler's Guide]]''. The route connected the [[planet]] [[Takodana]] in the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]] to the [[mining]] colony known as the [[Ring of Kafrene]] in the [[Expansion Region]], which acted as a junction onto the [[Rimma Trade Route]]. It then connected the colony with the planet [[Malastare]] back in the Mid Rim, which acted as a junction onto the [[Hydian Way]].<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Biox Detour was first mentioned in the [[2018]] reference book ''[[Star Wars: Smuggler's Guide]]'', which was written by [[Daniel Wallace]].<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

